(2710211, 376067, 51538, '<td valign="top">I remember visiting Lancing College in the 1980s.  The rafters were full of bats and there was quite a bit of guano on the floor in places.  The Saxon church at nearby Sompting is also a nice photo location.  Nice work, as usual.  Can only be Marbo, surely.  Otherwise I will eat my hat.</td>', 'I remember visiting Lancing College in the 1980s.  The rafters were full of bats and there was quite a bit of guano on the floor in places.  The Saxon church at nearby Sompting is also a nice photo location.  Nice work, as usual.  Can only be Marbo, surely.  Otherwise I will eat my hat.', '2006-08-09 10:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710213, 375988, 2170, '<td valign="top">this would fit the challenge more if you could see the bottom of her boot...like she was stepping on you.  as it is, it''s just a low-profile shot.</td>', 'this would fit the challenge more if you could see the bottom of her boot...like she was stepping on you.  as it is, it''s just a low-profile shot.', '2006-08-09 10:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
