(2710253, 376407, 52336, '<td valign="top">I would encourage you to make sure you use the full 640 pixels on one side that you are allowed with your entries.  That way, we can get the full impact of your photographs.</td>', 'I would encourage you to make sure you use the full 640 pixels on one side that you are allowed with your entries.  That way, we can get the full impact of your photographs.', '2006-08-09 10:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710261, 375360, 52336, '<td valign="top">Neat!  I think it might have been cool as a b/w image, with the flash not quite so strong.</td>', 'Neat!  I think it might have been cool as a b/w image, with the flash not quite so strong.', '2006-08-09 11:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710262, 377540, 52336, '<td valign="top">In order for others to really appreciate your photographs, you should submit the largest images allowed, that is, 640 pixels on one side.</td>', 'In order for others to really appreciate your photographs, you should submit the largest images allowed, that is, 640 pixels on one side.', '2006-08-09 11:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710266, 377101, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely, very pleasing composition.  Slightly blown in places, but an otherwise lovely image.</td>', 'Lovely, very pleasing composition.  Slightly blown in places, but an otherwise lovely image.', '2006-08-09 11:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710270, 377566, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Please post your gear and settings.  I wonder if a bit more sharpening would have made this very dramatic.</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Please post your gear and settings.  I wonder if a bit more sharpening would have made this very dramatic.', '2006-08-09 11:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710271, 376987, 51538, '<td valign="top">A breath of fresh air, so-to-speak!  And it is indeed a big sky.  NIcely exposed IMO.  The framing is pleasant. 8.</td>', 'A breath of fresh air, so-to-speak!  And it is indeed a big sky.  NIcely exposed IMO.  The framing is pleasant. 8.', '2006-08-09 11:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710272, 375595, 52336, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, I can''t believe you captured the big dipper.  Nice!</td>', 'Holy crap, I can''t believe you captured the big dipper.  Nice!', '2006-08-09 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710276, 377096, 52336, '<td valign="top">A bit too soft to appreciate fully, but a nice capture.</td>', 'A bit too soft to appreciate fully, but a nice capture.', '2006-08-09 11:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710278, 377407, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic both in terms fo the storm and in terms of the implied danger (the express train come down the track behind you).  The photo has multiple attractions.  Nice work.  8.</td>', 'Very dramatic both in terms fo the storm and in terms of the implied danger (the express train come down the track behind you).  The photo has multiple attractions.  Nice work.  8.', '2006-08-09 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710283, 374998, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good title.  We have them in NYC too and they are a darned noisy nuisance.  I live near the downtown area and mornings are often punctuated very early by these machines.  Such is life!  Nice focus, BTW. 8.</td>', 'Good title.  We have them in NYC too and they are a darned noisy nuisance.  I live near the downtown area and mornings are often punctuated very early by these machines.  Such is life!  Nice focus, BTW. 8.', '2006-08-09 11:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710285, 377302, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Betcha it''s a lily, not a dilly ;-)</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Betcha it''s a lily, not a dilly ;-)', '2006-08-09 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710294, 377573, 51538, '<td valign="top">Can it be anywhere other than NYC with those fire escapes?  They are hard things to photograph - but have a sculptural attractiveness.  I think you did a good job. 7.</td>', 'Can it be anywhere other than NYC with those fire escapes?  They are hard things to photograph - but have a sculptural attractiveness.  I think you did a good job. 7.', '2006-08-09 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710295, 374421, 52336, '<td valign="top">Neat. :)  Great idea, but I think if you had chosen just the magnifying glass boy as your subject and had him fill the frame more, without the blown out sky behind him, and with his expression just as it is, you''d really have a winner here.  Some noise reduction and sharpening, then enhancing the colours and contrasts with adjustment layers, and this could very well be a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Neat. :)  Great idea, but I think if you had chosen just the magnifying glass boy as your subject and had him fill the frame more, without the blown out sky behind him, and with his expression just as it is, you''d really have a winner here.  Some noise reduction and sharpening, then enhancing the colours and contrasts with adjustment layers, and this could very well be a ribbon winner.', '2006-08-09 11:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710298, 377201, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.  The colour blue is pleasing.</td>', 'Simple but effective.  The colour blue is pleasing.', '2006-08-09 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710301, 377455, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice symbolic image.  The duotone? is very pleasant.  I can''t think of anything wrong with this at all. 9.</td>', 'Nice symbolic image.  The duotone? is very pleasant.  I can''t think of anything wrong with this at all. 9.', '2006-08-09 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710303, 377360, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice, almost medieval.  Very lovely.</td>', 'Nice, almost medieval.  Very lovely.', '2006-08-09 11:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710304, 377329, 50641, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonality - wowee.  And I love the title ;-)</td>', 'Excellent tonality - wowee.  And I love the title ;-)', '2006-08-09 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710308, 376333, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition.  Would have benefitted from some work with adjustment layers to enhance colour and contrast.</td>', 'Very cool composition.  Would have benefitted from some work with adjustment layers to enhance colour and contrast.', '2006-08-09 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710310, 374861, 49672, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I love Jenga!</td>', 'Ha!  I love Jenga!', '2006-08-09 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710311, 375246, 50641, '<td valign="top">I''m very interested to know what I''m looking at.... clothing?</td>', 'I''m very interested to know what I''m looking at.... clothing?', '2006-08-09 11:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710313, 377427, 49672, '<td valign="top">Great title, great picture.</td>', 'Great title, great picture.', '2006-08-09 11:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710317, 377104, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I''m sure those are stage lights casting the shadow behind his leg, not much you can do about that, but looks a bit harsh.  Otherwise, awesome duotone, and just a cool image.</td>', 'Great capture.  I''m sure those are stage lights casting the shadow behind his leg, not much you can do about that, but looks a bit harsh.  Otherwise, awesome duotone, and just a cool image.', '2006-08-09 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710318, 375503, 49672, '<td valign="top">I would rate it higher if the rope wasn''t there.  (And if I was Scottish!)</td>', 'I would rate it higher if the rope wasn''t there.  (And if I was Scottish!)', '2006-08-09 11:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710320, 376067, 49672, '<td valign="top">I love IR.</td>', 'I love IR.', '2006-08-09 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710322, 375236, 51538, '<td valign="top">This location has some potential.  It reminds me of Andrew Wyeth''s painting, Christina''s World, in which the crippled girl looks up the dry hillside to a house.  From the ground up - from the crippled girl''s point of view - is the view of the painting and she is only able to drag herself along the ground.  It is a most evocative painting.  Your photo has some potential in that sort of area.  I''m rambling here... 7.</td>', 'This location has some potential.  It reminds me of Andrew Wyeth''s painting, Christina''s World, in which the crippled girl looks up the dry hillside to a house.  From the ground up - from the crippled girl''s point of view - is the view of the painting and she is only able to drag herself along the ground.  It is a most evocative painting.  Your photo has some potential in that sort of area.  I''m rambling here... 7.', '2006-08-09 11:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710325, 376715, 49672, '<td valign="top">Would probably do better if the perspective were looking ''up'', but it is a crisp clear pic with nice colors.</td>', 'Would probably do better if the perspective were looking ''up'', but it is a crisp clear pic with nice colors.', '2006-08-09 11:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710327, 376054, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, minimalist.  Would really have benefitted from some more sharpening, and a different crop or composition (the balance feels like it needs work somehow).  Otherwise a lovely image.</td>', 'Nice, simple, minimalist.  Would really have benefitted from some more sharpening, and a different crop or composition (the balance feels like it needs work somehow).  Otherwise a lovely image.', '2006-08-09 11:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710330, 377490, 49672, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.</td>', 'Neat shot.', '2006-08-09 11:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710331, 376453, 62578, '<td valign="top">nice title, but it''s just too blurry</td>', 'nice title, but it''s just too blurry', '2006-08-09 11:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710333, 377329, 51538, '<td valign="top">You deserve what you get for this entry ;-)  Not even sure what I mean there.  I think it is an interesting interpretation and the humour is just fine with me.</td>', 'You deserve what you get for this entry ;-)  Not even sure what I mean there.  I think it is an interesting interpretation and the humour is just fine with me.', '2006-08-09 11:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710336, 377274, 49672, '<td valign="top">This would have done wonderfully in a Shallow DOF/bokeh contest!  Nice shot.</td>', 'This would have done wonderfully in a Shallow DOF/bokeh contest!  Nice shot.', '2006-08-09 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710338, 376127, 52336, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  I''ve always wanted to be able to take pictures like this.  I''ve been watching Mansbridge on CBC aboard the icebreaker Louis St. Laurent, and have seen some stunning shots of arctic ice and sea.  Believe it or not, I wish I was where you are now. :)</td>', 'Cool image.  I''ve always wanted to be able to take pictures like this.  I''ve been watching Mansbridge on CBC aboard the icebreaker Louis St. Laurent, and have seen some stunning shots of arctic ice and sea.  Believe it or not, I wish I was where you are now. :)', '2006-08-09 11:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710340, 375503, 51538, '<td valign="top">A blinking silly title.  But a great photo.  The story portrayed is entertaining and informing.  Nice work.  But work on your titles please ;-) 7.</td>', 'A blinking silly title.  But a great photo.  The story portrayed is entertaining and informing.  Nice work.  But work on your titles please ;-) 7.', '2006-08-09 11:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710341, 376387, 50641, '<td valign="top">maple?  apple?  Wow, I guess it isn''t summer where you are.  Cute child.  Larger picture would be better.</td>', 'maple?  apple?  Wow, I guess it isn''t summer where you are.  Cute child.  Larger picture would be better.', '2006-08-09 11:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710342, 376943, 62578, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2006-08-09 11:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710346, 374079, 62578, '<td valign="top">i love your lighting...the shadow is great!</td>', 'i love your lighting...the shadow is great!', '2006-08-09 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710348, 377359, 51538, '<td valign="top">Do you mean those economic terrorists?  Nice photo - ugly association though. 7.</td>', 'Do you mean those economic terrorists?  Nice photo - ugly association though. 7.', '2006-08-09 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710350, 377274, 62578, '<td valign="top">beautiful...how''d you do it!? (i''m a novice!)  8</td>', 'beautiful...how''d you do it!? (i''m a novice!)  8', '2006-08-09 11:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710351, 376419, 50641, '<td valign="top">Classic pose.  Nice comp and silhouette.</td>', 'Classic pose.  Nice comp and silhouette.', '2006-08-09 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
