(2710739, 376386, 30637, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say "from the ground up." Not fond of prominently displayed poster.</td>', 'Doesn''t say "from the ground up." Not fond of prominently displayed poster.', '2006-08-09 12:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710741, 375263, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of the trees. I think this would be a great shot if cropped to get just a narrow band of the trees around the thick birch, cropping out the fallen log and the "cattle guard" sign. It''s kind of busy as it is.</td>', 'Nice rendition of the trees. I think this would be a great shot if cropped to get just a narrow band of the trees around the thick birch, cropping out the fallen log and the "cattle guard" sign. It''s kind of busy as it is.', '2006-08-09 12:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710742, 376979, 30637, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say from ground up to me.</td>', 'Doesn''t say from ground up to me.', '2006-08-09 12:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710744, 376696, 30637, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the date stamp</td>', 'Not sure about the date stamp', '2006-08-09 12:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710746, 376662, 12733, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, great colors.</td>', 'Strong composition, great colors.', '2006-08-09 12:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710748, 377556, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and composition. I''ll forgive the bad pun in the title - it''s the photo that I rate.</td>', 'Nice detail and composition. I''ll forgive the bad pun in the title - it''s the photo that I rate.', '2006-08-09 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710752, 374962, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nah, he''s just taking a picture. April fool!</td>', 'Nah, he''s just taking a picture. April fool!', '2006-08-09 12:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710755, 377570, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is simply frightening.  Also well shot.  Perhaps if the entire dog were in sharp focus it would be even better.</td>', 'This is simply frightening.  Also well shot.  Perhaps if the entire dog were in sharp focus it would be even better.', '2006-08-09 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710757, 375362, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty silhouette. Might be more effective if you took part of the picture and presented it as a vertical.</td>', 'Pretty silhouette. Might be more effective if you took part of the picture and presented it as a vertical.', '2006-08-09 12:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710766, 375521, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great upward effect, really meets the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Great upward effect, really meets the spirit of the challenge.', '2006-08-09 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710773, 375443, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the dark, constructed trestle and the bright, natural flower.</td>', 'Great contrast between the dark, constructed trestle and the bright, natural flower.', '2006-08-09 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710776, 377105, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Great facial expressions.  I hope you paid your models well.</td>', 'Very well done.  Great facial expressions.  I hope you paid your models well.', '2006-08-09 12:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710779, 376987, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but perhaps a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'Nice colors, but perhaps a bit over sharpened.', '2006-08-09 12:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710780, 375684, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a great sense of soaring trees. I can''t say whether the infrared adds anything, but it''s a great composition and visual effect.</td>', 'What a great sense of soaring trees. I can''t say whether the infrared adds anything, but it''s a great composition and visual effect.', '2006-08-09 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710787, 377356, 12733, '<td valign="top">The bug is a great addition to a very pretty flower photo.</td>', 'The bug is a great addition to a very pretty flower photo.', '2006-08-09 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710791, 377090, 45754, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2006-08-09 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710796, 377573, 12733, '<td valign="top">The fire escapes are very effective in showing the upward perspective.</td>', 'The fire escapes are very effective in showing the upward perspective.', '2006-08-09 13:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710799, 376611, 12733, '<td valign="top">That flag is kind of blurry after going through it all.</td>', 'That flag is kind of blurry after going through it all.', '2006-08-09 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710804, 377359, 12733, '<td valign="top">The framing curve and the reflections create an unusual and striking effect.</td>', 'The framing curve and the reflections create an unusual and striking effect.', '2006-08-09 13:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710809, 377105, 12733, '<td valign="top">very cute, if too obviously contrived.</td>', 'very cute, if too obviously contrived.', '2006-08-09 13:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710824, 374464, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very nice complement of colors.  I''ll go out on a limb and say top 10.</td>', 'Very nice complement of colors.  I''ll go out on a limb and say top 10.', '2006-08-09 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710838, 377414, 12733, '<td valign="top">A strong composition. The sepia rendition suits this picture well.</td>', 'A strong composition. The sepia rendition suits this picture well.', '2006-08-09 13:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710843, 377088, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great catch - or are they trained to pose like this?</td>', 'Great catch - or are they trained to pose like this?', '2006-08-09 13:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710846, 374758, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and soaring, upward effect.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and soaring, upward effect.', '2006-08-09 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710853, 374641, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp leaves, but the flower is a blur. And the background doesn''t help.</td>', 'Nice sharp leaves, but the flower is a blur. And the background doesn''t help.', '2006-08-09 13:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710865, 377459, 61234, '<td valign="top">I believe this to be a top contender. I love it for its simplicity, grace and beauty. Well done indeed. See you on page one next week ;)</td>', 'I believe this to be a top contender. I love it for its simplicity, grace and beauty. Well done indeed. See you on page one next week ;)', '2006-08-09 13:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710866, 375997, 61234, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots in this competition. That''s why I think it will be a top contender for a ribbon. Perfect on so many levels. It evokes much emotion. Well done!</td>', 'One of my favorite shots in this competition. That''s why I think it will be a top contender for a ribbon. Perfect on so many levels. It evokes much emotion. Well done!', '2006-08-09 13:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710870, 377356, 61234, '<td valign="top">iThink this will do extremely well. Well seen and captured. I love it!</td>', 'iThink this will do extremely well. Well seen and captured. I love it!', '2006-08-09 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710873, 377561, 61234, '<td valign="top">This is sure to be a top pick. Stunning colors and wonderful composition.<br/>Very pleasing image.</td>', 'This is sure to be a top pick. Stunning colors and wonderful composition.Very pleasing image.', '2006-08-09 13:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710876, 377607, 61234, '<td valign="top">This is great. A top pick for me.</td>', 'This is great. A top pick for me.', '2006-08-09 13:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710880, 376453, 61234, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Original and well done on all levels. A top pick in my book!</td>', 'Excellent! Original and well done on all levels. A top pick in my book!', '2006-08-09 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710885, 376484, 61234, '<td valign="top">Lighting is everything and you''ve done a superb job of capturing it here.<br/>Excellent job. Sure to do well in my humble opinion :)</td>', 'Lighting is everything and you''ve done a superb job of capturing it here.Excellent job. Sure to do well in my humble opinion :)', '2006-08-09 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710890, 377212, 50982, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you pulled that off in basic editing but good idea. A bit too overexposed on some parts of the sled.</td>', 'Not sure how you pulled that off in basic editing but good idea. A bit too overexposed on some parts of the sled.', '2006-08-09 13:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710892, 375950, 61234, '<td valign="top">Love the mood portrayed here. You did a great job capturing the essence of the mysteriously beautiful forested landscape. Sure to do well!</td>', 'Love the mood portrayed here. You did a great job capturing the essence of the mysteriously beautiful forested landscape. Sure to do well!', '2006-08-09 13:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710897, 376017, 57320, '<td valign="top">This is really good, but it needs somthing and I can''t put my finger on it.....</td>', 'This is really good, but it needs somthing and I can''t put my finger on it.....', '2006-08-09 13:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710912, 377540, 57320, '<td valign="top">too small</td>', 'too small', '2006-08-09 13:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710915, 377273, 57320, '<td valign="top">I like this, it almost makes me dizzy.</td>', 'I like this, it almost makes me dizzy.', '2006-08-09 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710917, 374421, 57320, '<td valign="top">This would be a 10 if it had, had more post-production</td>', 'This would be a 10 if it had, had more post-production', '2006-08-09 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710921, 377293, 57320, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is AMAZING 10 10 10 10</td>', 'Wow, this is AMAZING 10 10 10 10', '2006-08-09 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710927, 374011, 57320, '<td valign="top">Bravo, I''m not really much of a horse person. But this is really great!</td>', 'Bravo, I''m not really much of a horse person. But this is really great!', '2006-08-09 13:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710933, 376696, 41008, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that you''ll be disqualified... no text can appear on the images.</td>', 'I''m afraid that you''ll be disqualified... no text can appear on the images.', '2006-08-09 13:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710950, 375994, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, I would have liked the photo better without any people in the photo...I know sometimes that''s impossible...I like Architecture...nice photo.</td>', 'For me, I would have liked the photo better without any people in the photo...I know sometimes that''s impossible...I like Architecture...nice photo.', '2006-08-09 13:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710953, 377486, 52127, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like the bokeh in the leaves. Great saturation levels. Great job!</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like the bokeh in the leaves. Great saturation levels. Great job!', '2006-08-09 13:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710954, 377457, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but something about it makes me think it''s not a real dragonfly...I''m probably wrong though. I like the colors and focus.</td>', 'I like the photo but something about it makes me think it''s not a real dragonfly...I''m probably wrong though. I like the colors and focus.', '2006-08-09 13:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710958, 375790, 62187, '<td valign="top">Weird lighting for sure but very nice. I think it would have been perfect except for the crop...(to the right).</td>', 'Weird lighting for sure but very nice. I think it would have been perfect except for the crop...(to the right).', '2006-08-09 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710966, 376127, 55414, '<td valign="top">It Works.</td>', 'It Works.', '2006-08-09 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710967, 375943, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like a painting to me...I''ll take the benefit of the doubt and go with you and say it''s a super cool photo. I''d like to know the details and try it myself sometime.</td>', 'It looks like a painting to me...I''ll take the benefit of the doubt and go with you and say it''s a super cool photo. I''d like to know the details and try it myself sometime.', '2006-08-09 13:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710973, 377538, 62187, '<td valign="top">Another Architecture shot...but I like it. Some of the lines on the building to the left look oversharpened.</td>', 'Another Architecture shot...but I like it. Some of the lines on the building to the left look oversharpened.', '2006-08-09 13:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710983, 374464, 63104, '<td valign="top">liking the orange and blue, always my favourite colour combination, and nicely captured here. Think the sky might be slightly overcooked, but this would still make a great poster or calendar image. Well done.</td>', 'liking the orange and blue, always my favourite colour combination, and nicely captured here. Think the sky might be slightly overcooked, but this would still make a great poster or calendar image. Well done.', '2006-08-09 13:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710985, 376653, 62187, '<td valign="top">Too cool...I hope this is one of the top 3....giving it a 10.</td>', 'Too cool...I hope this is one of the top 3....giving it a 10.', '2006-08-09 13:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710995, 376679, 63104, '<td valign="top">I really like the cool gray and the blue sky, but I''d like to see the columns centered and straightened. The converging verticals are fine, the challenge is from the ground up, after all, its just the slight tilt to the right that is evident.</td>', 'I really like the cool gray and the blue sky, but I''d like to see the columns centered and straightened. The converging verticals are fine, the challenge is from the ground up, after all, its just the slight tilt to the right that is evident.', '2006-08-09 14:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710998, 375246, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!  I''d recognize those boots anywhwere :)   Amazing capture.   I''ve never seen that structure look so incredibly striking!  Ilove the vibrant colors in this and dead-on focus.   I love this one. . .and think it is perfectly executed.  Flawless, so I''m giving it a 10!</td>', 'Oh yeah!  I''d recognize those boots anywhwere :)   Amazing capture.   I''ve never seen that structure look so incredibly striking!  Ilove the vibrant colors in this and dead-on focus.   I love this one. . .and think it is perfectly executed.  Flawless, so I''m giving it a 10!', '2006-08-09 14:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710999, 376453, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hope people will not pass this one over because the thumbnail version was not that impressive. I think those that have taken the time to look at this larger version will be impressed. Awesome photo...thanks!</td>', 'I hope people will not pass this one over because the thumbnail version was not that impressive. I think those that have taken the time to look at this larger version will be impressed. Awesome photo...thanks!', '2006-08-09 14:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711005, 376645, 62187, '<td valign="top">Neat...! I definately like this one a lot!</td>', 'Neat...! I definately like this one a lot!', '2006-08-09 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711006, 377358, 63104, '<td valign="top">like the the all the way up part, but not the reverse. I assume the image wasn''t as interesting as you had hoped and thats why you reversed it. I still would have liked to see the original though.</td>', 'like the the all the way up part, but not the reverse. I assume the image wasn''t as interesting as you had hoped and thats why you reversed it. I still would have liked to see the original though.', '2006-08-09 14:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711012, 377031, 62187, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite geological rock formations...but the color looks funny to me...lichens?</td>', 'One of my favorite geological rock formations...but the color looks funny to me...lichens?', '2006-08-09 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711014, 375236, 59215, '<td valign="top">Cool idea- fun perspective and great colors, but a little overprocessed. I would suggest getting rid of "force field" glow around the structure... and maybe less blur/noice reduction so that it doesn''t look as muddy.</td>', 'Cool idea- fun perspective and great colors, but a little overprocessed. I would suggest getting rid of "force field" glow around the structure... and maybe less blur/noice reduction so that it doesn''t look as muddy.', '2006-08-09 14:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711016, 377213, 61234, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Makes me curious as to where it was taken. If I might venture a guess, Italy or France. I like the faded blue doors and windows amid the greens and greys. Well captured!</td>', 'I love this image. Makes me curious as to where it was taken. If I might venture a guess, Italy or France. I like the faded blue doors and windows amid the greens and greys. Well captured!', '2006-08-09 14:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711028, 377436, 61234, '<td valign="top">Great image. Put a smile on my face and that always gets big points from me.</td>', 'Great image. Put a smile on my face and that always gets big points from me.', '2006-08-09 14:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711031, 375595, 62187, '<td valign="top">The ''Big Dipper'' is actually an Asterism in the Constellation of Ursa Major...it''s a nice photo, meets the challenge but I think maybe just a little bit later in the evening would have strenghtened the brightness of the stars and greatly improved your photo. However, I like the colors too...compromise...I like that!</td>', 'The ''Big Dipper'' is actually an Asterism in the Constellation of Ursa Major...it''s a nice photo, meets the challenge but I think maybe just a little bit later in the evening would have strenghtened the brightness of the stars and greatly improved your photo. However, I like the colors too...compromise...I like that!', '2006-08-09 14:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711044, 375439, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection in the glass.</td>', 'I like the reflection in the glass.', '2006-08-09 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711052, 375876, 62187, '<td valign="top">A touch of vignetteing in the top corner may hurt for a better score.</td>', 'A touch of vignetteing in the top corner may hurt for a better score.', '2006-08-09 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711057, 376700, 63104, '<td valign="top">I really like the components of this image, the building and the tree. Just two small things I''d say, and I took a quick look at the rules for basic editing to make sure they were doable.<br/> <br/>Firstly, there is a fair amount of lean that could easily be corrected by rotating the picture, and secondly I''d be interested to see what the image would look like in B &amp; W, since its very much in monochrome already.</td>', 'I really like the components of this image, the building and the tree. Just two small things I''d say, and I took a quick look at the rules for basic editing to make sure they were doable. Firstly, there is a fair amount of lean that could easily be corrected by rotating the picture, and secondly I''d be interested to see what the image would look like in B & W, since its very much in monochrome already.', '2006-08-09 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711061, 377201, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections, crop and angle...nice!</td>', 'I like the reflections, crop and angle...nice!', '2006-08-09 14:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711070, 375532, 45651, '<td valign="top">These needs a little more head room for me.</td>', 'These needs a little more head room for me.', '2006-08-09 14:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711073, 374773, 59215, '<td valign="top">I like the composition- lots of fun lines. I''m not very fond of the smooth/chrome/plastic quality- just makes the picture feel strange.</td>', 'I like the composition- lots of fun lines. I''m not very fond of the smooth/chrome/plastic quality- just makes the picture feel strange.', '2006-08-09 14:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711075, 377581, 63104, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think you could have exaggerated the viewpoint even more for extra impact. A wider lens and even lower viewpoint with the camera could move this from a good shot to a great shot.</td>', 'I like this, but I think you could have exaggerated the viewpoint even more for extra impact. A wider lens and even lower viewpoint with the camera could move this from a good shot to a great shot.', '2006-08-09 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711088, 377551, 63329, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Is this studio?</td>', 'Love the colors. Is this studio?', '2006-08-09 14:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711090, 377204, 62187, '<td valign="top">Howdy Farmer - Funny title...Don''t want to sound corny but it looks a little grainy! Hope you don''t get mowed down. Just kiddin''...I like the photo...good luck to ya!</td>', 'Howdy Farmer - Funny title...Don''t want to sound corny but it looks a little grainy! Hope you don''t get mowed down. Just kiddin''...I like the photo...good luck to ya!', '2006-08-09 14:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711093, 377436, 63329, '<td valign="top">Funny</td>', 'Funny', '2006-08-09 14:22:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2711095, 377444, 43298, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is actually from the ground up ;) One of my faves of the challenge :)</td>', 'Wow, this is actually from the ground up ;) One of my faves of the challenge :)', '2006-08-09 14:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711099, 377112, 62187, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo. I could have done without the bicycle (others may think it a good thing), it does seem a little tilted to the right. But, I like the lighting, colors, subject of the train and the motion. It still meets the challenge...to bad it wasn''t in ''Action II''.</td>', 'I really like the photo. I could have done without the bicycle (others may think it a good thing), it does seem a little tilted to the right. But, I like the lighting, colors, subject of the train and the motion. It still meets the challenge...to bad it wasn''t in ''Action II''.', '2006-08-09 14:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711107, 377237, 2170, '<td valign="top">for a kid feet shot, this is pretty great.</td>', 'for a kid feet shot, this is pretty great.', '2006-08-09 14:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711108, 377242, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not a believer but you ''sold'' me...nice photo! I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'I''m not a believer but you ''sold'' me...nice photo! I hope it does well for you.', '2006-08-09 14:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711112, 375362, 43298, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, I really like silouettes :)</td>', 'This is really cool, I really like silouettes :)', '2006-08-09 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711114, 375303, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...is it for sale? Looks like a great project in a nice location.</td>', 'Very pretty...is it for sale? Looks like a great project in a nice location.', '2006-08-09 14:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711116, 377457, 43298, '<td valign="top">Wow, great DOF!</td>', 'Wow, great DOF!', '2006-08-09 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711117, 376610, 62187, '<td valign="top">Ansel? (would be proud!) I''d pick ''11'' if it went that high!</td>', 'Ansel? (would be proud!) I''d pick ''11'' if it went that high!', '2006-08-09 14:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711119, 375532, 43298, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea! Very effective :)</td>', 'This is a great idea! Very effective :)', '2006-08-09 14:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711120, 376230, 62187, '<td valign="top">I got one of these near my house...nice job!</td>', 'I got one of these near my house...nice job!', '2006-08-09 14:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711124, 377105, 63664, '<td valign="top">I think you totally captured the theme of the constest and made a quirky twist. I honestly can not see how this photo could possibly be any better.</td>', 'I think you totally captured the theme of the constest and made a quirky twist. I honestly can not see how this photo could possibly be any better.', '2006-08-09 14:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711125, 375876, 55767, '<td valign="top">this pictures makes me homesick</td>', 'this pictures makes me homesick', '2006-08-09 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711129, 374011, 63664, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but I am a little lost as to how this ties into the theme. I think the angle of the lighting is brilliant, as well as the positioning of the subject.</td>', 'Great photo, but I am a little lost as to how this ties into the theme. I think the angle of the lighting is brilliant, as well as the positioning of the subject.', '2006-08-09 14:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711135, 377329, 62187, '<td valign="top">I hate when people use the challenge title in the title of their photo...but...this is a nice twist! I like my coffee like I like my women...in a cup! I''m teasing ok!</td>', 'I hate when people use the challenge title in the title of their photo...but...this is a nice twist! I like my coffee like I like my women...in a cup! I''m teasing ok!', '2006-08-09 14:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711136, 377550, 63664, '<td valign="top">Really interesting perspective of a very mundane subject. I would have liked to see the focal point be a little less centered by reframing and cropping for further interest.</td>', 'Really interesting perspective of a very mundane subject. I would have liked to see the focal point be a little less centered by reframing and cropping for further interest.', '2006-08-09 14:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711144, 375565, 63664, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, very punchy.</td>', 'I love the colors, very punchy.', '2006-08-09 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711147, 377090, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t like it but I have a feeling it will do well in the challenge. What''s up with the title?</td>', 'I don''t like it but I have a feeling it will do well in the challenge. What''s up with the title?', '2006-08-09 14:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
