(2711950, 377392, 59215, '<td valign="top">Could use a level adjustment... kind of dark/dull overall. Other than that, it''s very pretty and the composition is nice.</td>', 'Could use a level adjustment... kind of dark/dull overall. Other than that, it''s very pretty and the composition is nice.', '2006-08-09 18:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711956, 375062, 59215, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what caused it, but the rocks and ropes and person all have a force field/glow on them... too much adjustment with curves maybe?</td>', 'I''m not sure what caused it, but the rocks and ropes and person all have a force field/glow on them... too much adjustment with curves maybe?', '2006-08-09 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711959, 374009, 50255, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The lines make a great composition.  The lights add a nice spark (no pun intended) of interest.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The lines make a great composition.  The lights add a nice spark (no pun intended) of interest.', '2006-08-09 18:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711962, 376017, 50255, '<td valign="top">Great focus and very nice color.</td>', 'Great focus and very nice color.', '2006-08-09 18:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711964, 377234, 50255, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot.  Great colors...Nice focus.</td>', 'What a fun shot.  Great colors...Nice focus.', '2006-08-09 18:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711965, 377112, 15711, '<td valign="top">That little bicyclist makes the shot for me. That hint of movement by the train is great. This might be fun in black and white too. 7</td>', 'That little bicyclist makes the shot for me. That hint of movement by the train is great. This might be fun in black and white too. 7', '2006-08-09 18:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711966, 377436, 59215, '<td valign="top">Nice! I actually did laugh out loud when I saw this!</td>', 'Nice! I actually did laugh out loud when I saw this!', '2006-08-09 18:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711967, 376952, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the mixture of the curves and geometric shapes.</td>', 'I like the mixture of the curves and geometric shapes.', '2006-08-09 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711975, 377594, 50255, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.</td>', 'beautiful shot.', '2006-08-09 18:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711979, 377186, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. The whole vignette is pleasing and something we can relate too. I like the backlit effect on the pink flower.  The sky is a touch overexposed, probably due to the time of day.</td>', 'Nicely composed. The whole vignette is pleasing and something we can relate too. I like the backlit effect on the pink flower.  The sky is a touch overexposed, probably due to the time of day.', '2006-08-09 18:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711988, 375314, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the distorted fisheye effect. Nice colors.</td>', 'I like the distorted fisheye effect. Nice colors.', '2006-08-09 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711994, 376439, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice blend of the natural softness and the hard edges of the stones.  7</td>', 'Nice blend of the natural softness and the hard edges of the stones.  7', '2006-08-09 18:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711997, 374657, 50255, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  Great lines, great sky, great composition.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  Great lines, great sky, great composition.', '2006-08-09 19:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712006, 376665, 50255, '<td valign="top">Really interesting composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Really interesting composition.  Nicely done.', '2006-08-09 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712011, 375101, 56756, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2006-08-09 19:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712015, 376617, 15711, '<td valign="top">Kind of tired of jumping skateboarders, but this is good. The shadow to the left and the overall composition. I like the crop. Maybe a touch centered with the skater, but not a bad image overall.</td>', 'Kind of tired of jumping skateboarders, but this is good. The shadow to the left and the overall composition. I like the crop. Maybe a touch centered with the skater, but not a bad image overall.', '2006-08-09 19:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712018, 377180, 56756, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo.</td>', 'Brilliant photo.', '2006-08-09 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712020, 373892, 50255, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!</td>', 'What a great shot!', '2006-08-09 19:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712025, 377444, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like how he''s almost camouflaged with his arms recreating the "arms" of the tree.  Nice golden tones.</td>', 'Very nice. I like how he''s almost camouflaged with his arms recreating the "arms" of the tree.  Nice golden tones.', '2006-08-09 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712028, 376484, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The lighting is well done too. 7</td>', 'Nice composition. The lighting is well done too. 7', '2006-08-09 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712032, 374758, 50255, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot!  It''s got everything.  Night sky for drama.  Perfectly exposed.  Nice rule of 1/3rds composition.  It was also very tricky of you to create a hint of wind for the flags at the bottom.  Just perfect!</td>', 'Perfect shot!  It''s got everything.  Night sky for drama.  Perfectly exposed.  Nice rule of 1/3rds composition.  It was also very tricky of you to create a hint of wind for the flags at the bottom.  Just perfect!', '2006-08-09 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712035, 375790, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I like that "green" of the sky that you have before a storm. The use of negative space pulls you right back to the buildings hugging the shore.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I like that "green" of the sky that you have before a storm. The use of negative space pulls you right back to the buildings hugging the shore.', '2006-08-09 19:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712037, 377090, 50255, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot.  Looks like you''re on top of a building.</td>', 'Very fun shot.  Looks like you''re on top of a building.', '2006-08-09 19:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712045, 377305, 50255, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is good.</td>', 'Wow...this is good.', '2006-08-09 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712047, 375532, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this. Has a timeless feel to it. You could have cropped out the left third of the shot and made it more in portrait orientation, and it would have been just as effective. I know the grasses indicate that the camera is on the ground, but there are enough of them on the right to work, without those distracting ones on the left side.</td>', 'I like the idea of this. Has a timeless feel to it. You could have cropped out the left third of the shot and made it more in portrait orientation, and it would have been just as effective. I know the grasses indicate that the camera is on the ground, but there are enough of them on the right to work, without those distracting ones on the left side.', '2006-08-09 19:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712048, 376039, 50255, '<td valign="top">Incredible lines.</td>', 'Incredible lines.', '2006-08-09 19:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712052, 375101, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is that the Getty Museum in Los Angeles??</td>', 'Is that the Getty Museum in Los Angeles??', '2006-08-09 19:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
