(2712094, 374011, 61245, '<td valign="top">OMG, this is one of the coolest pictures I have ever seen!!! I definetely rate this by 10!!! The only thing I would change next time (if you will have a chance) is to flip the camera, so the legs are also in the picture. It might get a bigger "experience".<br/>Btw, don''t you have more of those? I would be very interested in seeing them. Thank you!</td>', 'OMG, this is one of the coolest pictures I have ever seen!!! I definetely rate this by 10!!! The only thing I would change next time (if you will have a chance) is to flip the camera, so the legs are also in the picture. It might get a bigger "experience".Btw, don''t you have more of those? I would be very interested in seeing them. Thank you!', '2006-08-09 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712107, 377298, 61245, '<td valign="top">Nice! I had this idea too :o)) The only thing I might change is to get the legs into the picture..</td>', 'Nice! I had this idea too :o)) The only thing I might change is to get the legs into the picture..', '2006-08-09 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
