(2712740, 377428, 41337, '<td valign="top">Really good composition here. The two strong lines running up are complimented nicely by the bright green leaves to the right. On the negative, I don''t feel DPC voters value everyday subjects like this even though this does NOT look like a snap shot. As such I think maybe you should have converted this to b/w or duotone or a selective desaturation leaving only the green color present. That along with the interesting composition would have added more impact, IMO. Good luck!</td>', 'Really good composition here. The two strong lines running up are complimented nicely by the bright green leaves to the right. On the negative, I don''t feel DPC voters value everyday subjects like this even though this does NOT look like a snap shot. As such I think maybe you should have converted this to b/w or duotone or a selective desaturation leaving only the green color present. That along with the interesting composition would have added more impact, IMO. Good luck!', '2006-08-09 22:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
