(2713344, 377581, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . this is AWESOME!   I love the little flecks of grass on her nose.</td>', 'Awwww. . . this is AWESOME!   I love the little flecks of grass on her nose.', '2006-08-10 01:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713345, 376333, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a fun photo!  I really love it.  I''m amazed at the clean, no-noise focus for a moving photo!!!    The clouds in the background give it that feeling that you are looking up into the sky.   This is great.</td>', 'What a fun photo!  I really love it.  I''m amazed at the clean, no-noise focus for a moving photo!!!    The clouds in the background give it that feeling that you are looking up into the sky.   This is great.', '2006-08-10 01:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713351, 376999, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is great - love everything about this - the complimentary colors of her top and skirt - her lean - great work - 8 for now</td>', 'this is great - love everything about this - the complimentary colors of her top and skirt - her lean - great work - 8 for now', '2006-08-10 01:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713370, 377572, 31403, '<td valign="top">more contrast would make this a stronger photo</td>', 'more contrast would make this a stronger photo', '2006-08-10 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713378, 374421, 31403, '<td valign="top">great facial expressions - I think a titch more contrast to bring out the definition in that tree would make it better, and maybe posing the boys so their heads are closer together in the composition so my eye doesn''t have to move so far to see both (my eye got tired going that far!) - but excellent creative and amazing execution 8 for now</td>', 'great facial expressions - I think a titch more contrast to bring out the definition in that tree would make it better, and maybe posing the boys so their heads are closer together in the composition so my eye doesn''t have to move so far to see both (my eye got tired going that far!) - but excellent creative and amazing execution 8 for now', '2006-08-10 01:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713383, 377581, 31403, '<td valign="top">whoever put that wire there really screwed up your shot!  Imagine how great this would be without it!  But what are you going to do?  If you cut it for the shot you could be in big trouble!  :-)<br/> <br/>Love the texture on the cow -</td>', 'whoever put that wire there really screwed up your shot!  Imagine how great this would be without it!  But what are you going to do?  If you cut it for the shot you could be in big trouble!  :-) Love the texture on the cow -', '2006-08-10 01:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
