(2713618, 376662, 62187, '<td valign="top">We''ve got one of these needle-like towers in Vegas - The Stratosphere. I''m not afraid of heights, in fact I''d love to be close to the edge, but I get vertigo really, really bad. So, I''ve only been atop the Stratosphere two times: once for my son''s birthday and the other with my job. (Some guy was gonna end his life by jumping off - the police negotiators talked him down thankfully. I guess that should be: they talked him up?). But both times I hated it, the view was unbelievable but I could hardly keep my balance. I prefer your view much better...thanks!</td>', 'We''ve got one of these needle-like towers in Vegas - The Stratosphere. I''m not afraid of heights, in fact I''d love to be close to the edge, but I get vertigo really, really bad. So, I''ve only been atop the Stratosphere two times: once for my son''s birthday and the other with my job. (Some guy was gonna end his life by jumping off - the police negotiators talked him down thankfully. I guess that should be: they talked him up?). But both times I hated it, the view was unbelievable but I could hardly keep my balance. I prefer your view much better...thanks!', '2006-08-10 04:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713619, 376604, 62187, '<td valign="top">The colors are awesome. In the thumbnail, I didn''t notice the cloud or helicopter - I''m glad I looked at the larger version. Nice job!</td>', 'The colors are awesome. In the thumbnail, I didn''t notice the cloud or helicopter - I''m glad I looked at the larger version. Nice job!', '2006-08-10 04:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
