(2717661, 376696, 24454, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.  I have a feeling you may be getting killed on this one.  Not that it''s a bad photo for this challenge -- but most dpc''ers are phobic about anything that looks like a dreaded snapshot, and I''m afraid the date screams "snapshot" for this one.  I won''t kill you because at least it meets the challenge and is not a dead straight on shot like lots of them here.<br/> <br/>But going forward, little things like cropping out the corner of the door frame on the left. . .and certainly the date will go a long way towards improving your score.   I hope it''s not as bad for you as I fear :(</td>', 'Uh-oh.  I have a feeling you may be getting killed on this one.  Not that it''s a bad photo for this challenge -- but most dpc''ers are phobic about anything that looks like a dreaded snapshot, and I''m afraid the date screams "snapshot" for this one.  I won''t kill you because at least it meets the challenge and is not a dead straight on shot like lots of them here. But going forward, little things like cropping out the corner of the door frame on the left. . .and certainly the date will go a long way towards improving your score.   I hope it''s not as bad for you as I fear :(', '2006-08-11 12:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
