(2717792, 374866, 61679, '<td valign="top">I fear that the DNMC crowd will not like this.  I like the out of the box thinking where you shot up by shooting down.  Gave it a 6.</td>', 'I fear that the DNMC crowd will not like this.  I like the out of the box thinking where you shot up by shooting down.  Gave it a 6.', '2006-08-11 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717793, 376218, 61679, '<td valign="top">You might want to consider rotating this 90 degrees clockwise and cropping out the partial palm tree and some of the empty sky at the top. This would provide a strong leading line from the tree trunk and the top of the tree would be at the upper node of the rule of thirds.  Otherwise, good focus and exposure and I like that the colors look natural and not super saturated.  I''m going to give this a 6, as the flaws are easily fixable.  You got the hard part right.</td>', 'You might want to consider rotating this 90 degrees clockwise and cropping out the partial palm tree and some of the empty sky at the top. This would provide a strong leading line from the tree trunk and the top of the tree would be at the upper node of the rule of thirds.  Otherwise, good focus and exposure and I like that the colors look natural and not super saturated.  I''m going to give this a 6, as the flaws are easily fixable.  You got the hard part right.', '2006-08-11 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717797, 375421, 40484, '<td valign="top">Godd choice of subject and composition. I think the presentation would be helped by a slight rotation to the right, to bring the horizontal lines parallel to the bottom of the frame and make the sides equal distance from the bottom.</td>', 'Godd choice of subject and composition. I think the presentation would be helped by a slight rotation to the right, to bring the horizontal lines parallel to the bottom of the frame and make the sides equal distance from the bottom.', '2006-08-11 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
