(2718449, 375354, 40370, '<td valign="top">While the indoor arena looks very interesting, the soft lighting and focus here do not really compliment a sports/action shot. Also, I see your subject''s back, I would prefer the intense look of concentration on his face, and I don''t quite get the connection to the challenge as your perspective looks straight on. 4</td>', 'While the indoor arena looks very interesting, the soft lighting and focus here do not really compliment a sports/action shot. Also, I see your subject''s back, I would prefer the intense look of concentration on his face, and I don''t quite get the connection to the challenge as your perspective looks straight on. 4', '2006-08-11 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
