(2718479, 376027, 40370, '<td valign="top">Lovely night shot, the reflection is very complimentary to the subject, the orange lights on the sides look like fire adding drama to the image. But ... I don''t quite get the "from the ground up" I am looking for. Yes, the statue is reaching up but there is too much foreground to feel that you were on the ground taking a picture. 5</td>', 'Lovely night shot, the reflection is very complimentary to the subject, the orange lights on the sides look like fire adding drama to the image. But ... I don''t quite get the "from the ground up" I am looking for. Yes, the statue is reaching up but there is too much foreground to feel that you were on the ground taking a picture. 5', '2006-08-11 17:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718482, 374019, 37444, '<td valign="top">0-2 Meets Challenge: 2<br/>0-2 Creativity: 2<br/>0-2 Technical Merit: 2<br/>0-2 Visual Appeal: 1<br/>0-1 Presentation: 1<br/>0-1 Biased WOW Factor: 0</td>', '0-2 Meets Challenge: 20-2 Creativity: 20-2 Technical Merit: 20-2 Visual Appeal: 10-1 Presentation: 10-1 Biased WOW Factor: 0', '2006-08-11 17:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
