(2718658, 376041, 40370, '<td valign="top">One of the most unique flowers I''ve ever seen. The pinks and yellows look very natural and the focus is very good. However, knowing flowers are low to the ground anyway, your perspective "up" is not very dramatic. Still pretty.</td>', 'One of the most unique flowers I''ve ever seen. The pinks and yellows look very natural and the focus is very good. However, knowing flowers are low to the ground anyway, your perspective "up" is not very dramatic. Still pretty.', '2006-08-11 17:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718669, 374464, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colors and the leading line of the sand to the clouds is good.  I''d love a single subject (ie: person, skull, something) to really ground it but well done and lovely complementary colors. 7</td>', 'Pleasing colors and the leading line of the sand to the clouds is good.  I''d love a single subject (ie: person, skull, something) to really ground it but well done and lovely complementary colors. 7', '2006-08-11 17:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
