(2718678, 377594, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see a tad more foreground.  Lovely perspective and the sky is gorgeous. 7</td>', 'I''d love to see a tad more foreground.  Lovely perspective and the sky is gorgeous. 7', '2006-08-11 17:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
