(2721891, 377436, 35530, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you "stewed" about the title for a long time. I''m giving it an extra point on that alone so you shouldn''t have a "beef" with me.</td>', 'I''m sure you "stewed" about the title for a long time. I''m giving it an extra point on that alone so you shouldn''t have a "beef" with me.', '2006-08-13 02:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
