(2721911, 375058, 35530, '<td valign="top">An appealing capture of an otherwise unappealing object. Focus and lighting are good and the contrast between the fire hydrant and sky is great. If I have to offer some advice, it would be to brush away the cobweb by the junction of the arm before the shot.</td>', 'An appealing capture of an otherwise unappealing object. Focus and lighting are good and the contrast between the fire hydrant and sky is great. If I have to offer some advice, it would be to brush away the cobweb by the junction of the arm before the shot.', '2006-08-13 02:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721924, 374421, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge. The boys expressions are priceless.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge. The boys expressions are priceless.', '2006-08-13 02:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721930, 376618, 35530, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot but I''m not sure how well it relates to this challenge. Still well done.</td>', 'Awesome shot but I''m not sure how well it relates to this challenge. Still well done.', '2006-08-13 02:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721944, 377547, 35530, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors. Too bad you can''t clone out the speck in the upper right corner. Still an 8 in my book.</td>', 'Stunning colors. Too bad you can''t clone out the speck in the upper right corner. Still an 8 in my book.', '2006-08-13 03:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721959, 376617, 35530, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing. Great focus and the angles make for an interesting composition. The only thing I see that might make it a little better IMHO is to have moved the crop so the whole barrier was included and the portion along the right side, which looks like a bad section of the ramp, was excluded.</td>', 'Perfect timing. Great focus and the angles make for an interesting composition. The only thing I see that might make it a little better IMHO is to have moved the crop so the whole barrier was included and the portion along the right side, which looks like a bad section of the ramp, was excluded.', '2006-08-13 03:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721966, 377000, 35530, '<td valign="top">Fun shot from an unusual angle.</td>', 'Fun shot from an unusual angle.', '2006-08-13 03:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721971, 374011, 53964, '<td valign="top">A wonderful photograph, but I really don''t see how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'A wonderful photograph, but I really don''t see how it fits the challenge.', '2006-08-13 03:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721978, 377090, 53964, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, hate the title :)</td>', 'Love the shot, hate the title :)', '2006-08-13 03:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721991, 376696, 35530, '<td valign="top">By now, you probably have heard enough about the date stamp so Ill hit on a few others. The lamp could have been placed to block the light switch. By moving the subject away from the backdrop you would eliminate some of the harsh shadow. There seems to be too many angles all at once which to me is distracting. Also, the doorframe doesn''t add anything and should be cropped out.<br/>Don''t dispare and keep at it. There are photographers on this site that CAN and DO take the most mundane things and have the knowledge and equipment to turn them into works of art. For the rest of us mortals, we have to just keep our eyes open and our cameras ready and hope for the best while learning bits and pieces from others.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'By now, you probably have heard enough about the date stamp so Ill hit on a few others. The lamp could have been placed to block the light switch. By moving the subject away from the backdrop you would eliminate some of the harsh shadow. There seems to be too many angles all at once which to me is distracting. Also, the doorframe doesn''t add anything and should be cropped out.Don''t dispare and keep at it. There are photographers on this site that CAN and DO take the most mundane things and have the knowledge and equipment to turn them into works of art. For the rest of us mortals, we have to just keep our eyes open and our cameras ready and hope for the best while learning bits and pieces from others.Good luck.', '2006-08-13 03:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722008, 377329, 61318, '<td valign="top">Is a very nice photo, well executed...but, I have to give you a DNMC here...the challenge description was clear.</td>', 'Is a very nice photo, well executed...but, I have to give you a DNMC here...the challenge description was clear.', '2006-08-13 04:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
