(2722134, 377594, 16912, '<td valign="top">Well, I had to return to the rules for this shot, it actually said ''from the ground up'' and muppet here misread as ''from the ground looking up''. This is looking across but yes, meets the challenge. Nice BIG sky and IMHO the inclusion of foreground grass sets this shot off well :)</td>', 'Well, I had to return to the rules for this shot, it actually said ''from the ground up'' and muppet here misread as ''from the ground looking up''. This is looking across but yes, meets the challenge. Nice BIG sky and IMHO the inclusion of foreground grass sets this shot off well :)', '2006-08-13 08:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
