(2722210, 375997, 10134, '<td valign="top">very nice light and comp. After finishing to view and vote for all the pictures, this is definitely my favorite. I would have cropped a bit the picture to remove the last stair and perhaps even the whole left part 5cm behind the little boy''s back... but anyway, i hope you''ll win, as for what i''ve seen in this contest, you totally deserve it !</td>', 'very nice light and comp. After finishing to view and vote for all the pictures, this is definitely my favorite. I would have cropped a bit the picture to remove the last stair and perhaps even the whole left part 5cm behind the little boy''s back... but anyway, i hope you''ll win, as for what i''ve seen in this contest, you totally deserve it !', '2006-08-13 10:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
