(2724988, 375434, 20941, '<td valign="top">Just goes to show that any subject can become artistic if its well visualized by the artist. This image breaks "rules" and has a common everyday subject, but you have presented a very cool image that I find quite pleasant to look at. Good work, good luck!</td>', 'Just goes to show that any subject can become artistic if its well visualized by the artist. This image breaks "rules" and has a common everyday subject, but you have presented a very cool image that I find quite pleasant to look at. Good work, good luck!', '2006-08-14 09:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
