(2729875, 375421, 32345, '<td valign="top">Good picture with great colors, but it would have been better if it was rotated a bit to get an even perspective.<br/> <br/>Good shot, 6</td>', 'Good picture with great colors, but it would have been better if it was rotated a bit to get an even perspective. Good shot, 6', '2006-08-15 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729880, 374011, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great picture but it does not really meet the challenge.</td>', 'Great picture but it does not really meet the challenge.', '2006-08-15 16:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729881, 376090, 62095, '<td valign="top">This photo is okay but I find it a bit busy, it doesn''t quite fit the theme of the challenge to me, though obviously the angle is upwards it''s more like a "from slightly above the ground across".  Also the chaps head is cut off to the top left and the building at top right has an ugly aerial on it, so maybe a shift more up and left would have worked better for me.</td>', 'This photo is okay but I find it a bit busy, it doesn''t quite fit the theme of the challenge to me, though obviously the angle is upwards it''s more like a "from slightly above the ground across".  Also the chaps head is cut off to the top left and the building at top right has an ugly aerial on it, so maybe a shift more up and left would have worked better for me.', '2006-08-15 16:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729882, 377494, 32345, '<td valign="top">It would have been a lot better with more deep of field.</td>', 'It would have been a lot better with more deep of field.', '2006-08-15 16:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729885, 377436, 62095, '<td valign="top">Moo. Maybe it''s a milking cow.  Good perspective, shame about the cut off ear. I like cows and the eyes have good light so a reasonable score.</td>', 'Moo. Maybe it''s a milking cow.  Good perspective, shame about the cut off ear. I like cows and the eyes have good light so a reasonable score.', '2006-08-15 16:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729886, 374997, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great point of view, but it look overprocessed, just my opinion.</td>', 'Great point of view, but it look overprocessed, just my opinion.', '2006-08-15 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729889, 374997, 62095, '<td valign="top">that''s very low.  Unfortunately the plane has almost a "stuck on" quality and it seems as though the shot was taken a nudge too early, would have been nice to have the front wing in there.</td>', 'that''s very low.  Unfortunately the plane has almost a "stuck on" quality and it seems as though the shot was taken a nudge too early, would have been nice to have the front wing in there.', '2006-08-15 16:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
