(2729914, 376709, 62095, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this picture exciting enough to get a great mark.  The tiles and dog are a bit dark and muted.</td>', 'I don''t find this picture exciting enough to get a great mark.  The tiles and dog are a bit dark and muted.', '2006-08-15 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729920, 376318, 62095, '<td valign="top">Yep.  They are smokestacks. Definitely meets challenge.  Can''t think of much else to say about it though.  Maybe another point of interest would have helped it.</td>', 'Yep.  They are smokestacks. Definitely meets challenge.  Can''t think of much else to say about it though.  Maybe another point of interest would have helped it.', '2006-08-15 16:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729925, 375261, 62095, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  A bit untidy looking though, for example the bit of bush at the bottom, and the other items poking in to the photo around the top corners.  Maybe a few less items of clothes on the line would work.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  A bit untidy looking though, for example the bit of bush at the bottom, and the other items poking in to the photo around the top corners.  Maybe a few less items of clothes on the line would work.', '2006-08-15 16:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
