(2733865, 376712, 60047, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by ClubJuggle - Removed comments from side discussion.</i></td>', 'Impressive shot.Message edited by ClubJuggle - Removed comments from side discussion.', '2006-08-16 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2733895, 375997, 52140, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Love it actually. But I have an observation, which I''m sure it''s just a mistake, but how could you use an aperture of 2.8 on a lens that only goes to 4.0?<br/> <br/>Also, congrats!</td>', 'I really like this shot. Love it actually. But I have an observation, which I''m sure it''s just a mistake, but how could you use an aperture of 2.8 on a lens that only goes to 4.0? Also, congrats!', '2006-08-16 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2733937, 374464, 40370, '<td valign="top">hey Brett - we just painted my son''s room that same deep orange color (lower 1/3 of the wall) and a dark blue denim color for the upper part, boy sure wish I could simulate the texture and the clouds - then I''d have to trade him rooms cause it would be so beautiful. <br/> <br/>Congrats on top ten.</td>', 'hey Brett - we just painted my son''s room that same deep orange color (lower 1/3 of the wall) and a dark blue denim color for the upper part, boy sure wish I could simulate the texture and the clouds - then I''d have to trade him rooms cause it would be so beautiful.  Congrats on top ten.', '2006-08-16 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2733961, 377569, 54747, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments.  I felt like a complete choad when I realized I had uploaded the image for the Transportation to the From the Ground Up challenge.  I''m surprised it did as well as it did, given the entirely wrong challenge :)<br/> <br/>tuffy, I definitely can see the benefit to the DOF, and actually went out and took a couple more with at f/16.  They look much nicer, I think.</td>', 'thanks for all the comments.  I felt like a complete choad when I realized I had uploaded the image for the Transportation to the From the Ground Up challenge.  I''m surprised it did as well as it did, given the entirely wrong challenge :) tuffy, I definitely can see the benefit to the DOF, and actually went out and took a couple more with at f/16.  They look much nicer, I think.', '2006-08-16 13:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734025, 375997, 32997, '<td valign="top">oops had wrong lens down..thanks!</td>', 'oops had wrong lens down..thanks!', '2006-08-16 14:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
