(2734641, 377105, 52713, '<td valign="top">I had this one getting the blue. I thought it was great</td>', 'I had this one getting the blue. I thought it was great', '2006-08-16 16:57:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734708, 375206, 57839, '<td valign="top">It is funny how so many believe you must have sharp focus to have a "good" photo.  No offense to those that feel that way, but to me sharper is not always better.  I achieved the look I was shooting for with this shot, and while I respect the voters opinions I find it a bit hard to believe this is a 4.2.</td>', 'It is funny how so many believe you must have sharp focus to have a "good" photo.  No offense to those that feel that way, but to me sharper is not always better.  I achieved the look I was shooting for with this shot, and while I respect the voters opinions I find it a bit hard to believe this is a 4.2.', '2006-08-16 17:17:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734716, 377105, 17990, '<td valign="top">Ups.... I loved this one... I was watching the thumbnails and it catch my attention so I voted it a 9... then I left the voting for "later" and never came back to vote for at least the 20%.. you lost my 9 <br/>:( ...But now in compensation, I`ll add it as a fav :D</td>', 'Ups.... I loved this one... I was watching the thumbnails and it catch my attention so I voted it a 9... then I left the voting for "later" and never came back to vote for at least the 20%.. you lost my 9 :( ...But now in compensation, I`ll add it as a fav :D', '2006-08-16 17:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734750, 375997, 2244, '<td valign="top">stunningly good !!!</td>', 'stunningly good !!!', '2006-08-16 17:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734753, 376712, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  Don''t worry about sour grapes comments.</td>', 'Congrats.  Don''t worry about sour grapes comments.', '2006-08-16 17:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734773, 377436, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - your cow beat my cow. ;~p<br/> <br/>What fun we had lying on the ground looking up at those bovine faces. Conrats on top 20.</td>', 'HEE HEE - your cow beat my cow. ;~p What fun we had lying on the ground looking up at those bovine faces. Conrats on top 20.', '2006-08-16 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734866, 377088, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow Dawn!   This is an amazing shot!   I am amazed that this one isn''t on the first page!  It''s so full of a "story" with those two squabbling with each other, and the other one looking on with morbid interest. ..just like people do!   Man, I love this!    This is going right into my favorites folder!<br/> <br/>And it seems I remember you saying on the last day that you had to go out and find something to shoot for this challenge!  Even more amazing!  You certainly found a good one  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow Dawn!   This is an amazing shot!   I am amazed that this one isn''t on the first page!  It''s so full of a "story" with those two squabbling with each other, and the other one looking on with morbid interest. ..just like people do!   Man, I love this!    This is going right into my favorites folder! And it seems I remember you saying on the last day that you had to go out and find something to shoot for this challenge!  Even more amazing!  You certainly found a good one  :) ', '2006-08-16 18:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734867, 377358, 60614, '<td valign="top">I definately like the B/W version for this shot.  Need to get it more in focus and play with the contrast a bit.  Definately more in focus.  Happy shooting.</td>', 'I definately like the B/W version for this shot.  Need to get it more in focus and play with the contrast a bit.  Definately more in focus.  Happy shooting.', '2006-08-16 18:23:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734886, 375854, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is such a striking image.  The dark sunset tones add appealm and the angle is very striking.  I''m surprised this wasn''t scored much much higher!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think this is such a striking image.  The dark sunset tones add appealm and the angle is very striking.  I''m surprised this wasn''t scored much much higher! ', '2006-08-16 18:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734904, 375997, 53548, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a great photo. this is going into my favorite folder straight away.</td>', 'Wow this is a great photo. this is going into my favorite folder straight away.', '2006-08-16 18:35:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734912, 375314, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  That splash of green against that dramatic sky make a great contrast, and the trees give scale to that massive building you are looking up at.  Another one that is quite underrated in my opinion!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like this.  That splash of green against that dramatic sky make a great contrast, and the trees give scale to that massive building you are looking up at.  Another one that is quite underrated in my opinion! ', '2006-08-16 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734934, 376712, 5112, '<td valign="top">Many congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Many congratulations on your ribbon!', '2006-08-16 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734944, 377358, 50231, '<td valign="top">Well my friend you are learning the hard way which is good. DPC does not like over processed images like this. I agree that the b&amp;w would have been a better way to go. Also I would have moved away from the building a bit so I could more easily tell what it was an image of. Keep on Keepin'' on my brotha''.<br/> <br/>The Wazz</td>', 'Well my friend you are learning the hard way which is good. DPC does not like over processed images like this. I agree that the b&w would have been a better way to go. Also I would have moved away from the building a bit so I could more easily tell what it was an image of. Keep on Keepin'' on my brotha''. The Wazz', '2006-08-16 18:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734981, 375997, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and emotive image...congrats!  :)</td>', 'Beautiful and emotive image...congrats!  :)', '2006-08-16 19:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734983, 377427, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot...congrats! :)</td>', 'Lovely shot...congrats! :)', '2006-08-16 19:17:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2734993, 377427, 15711, '<td valign="top">Way to go.  That''s wonderful - a first ribbon. WOO HOO</td>', 'Way to go.  That''s wonderful - a first ribbon. WOO HOO', '2006-08-16 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735008, 377615, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Sheesh, I too expected to see this do better.</td>', 'Lovely. Sheesh, I too expected to see this do better.', '2006-08-16 19:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735017, 377581, 50641, '<td valign="top">I always love a nostril shot ;-)  Ok, maybe that''s ''cows only''.  Great tones and texture here.  Congrats on the score...  especially considering that some people hate barbed wire, and others hate farm animals...  you had a double whammy!<br/> <br/>Given your comments during the challenge, I''d convinced myself that you had done a pun on the title instead of another cow.  Now, I hope to see this ol'' girl again in future challenges ;-)</td>', 'I always love a nostril shot ;-)  Ok, maybe that''s ''cows only''.  Great tones and texture here.  Congrats on the score...  especially considering that some people hate barbed wire, and others hate farm animals...  you had a double whammy! Given your comments during the challenge, I''d convinced myself that you had done a pun on the title instead of another cow.  Now, I hope to see this ol'' girl again in future challenges ;-)', '2006-08-16 19:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735025, 377427, 45475, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon Louis! Well deserved, this is truly an amazing shot!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon Louis! Well deserved, this is truly an amazing shot!', '2006-08-16 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735051, 375997, 38127, '<td valign="top">Gave you a 9 on this one.. absolutely fell in love with it.. <br/> <br/>So happy you got a ribbon :) Congratulations.. its a beautiful moment.</td>', 'Gave you a 9 on this one.. absolutely fell in love with it..  So happy you got a ribbon :) Congratulations.. its a beautiful moment.', '2006-08-16 19:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735104, 377447, 41337, '<td valign="top">How in the world did this score under a 6? I can only guess that windmills are "in" and water towers are not.</td>', 'How in the world did this score under a 6? I can only guess that windmills are "in" and water towers are not.', '2006-08-16 20:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735115, 376484, 54232, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  I know why I liked it, but I was looking for something more in the low 5s...not sure what went wrong ;)<br/> <br/>The light was direct sunlight.<br/> <br/>PP:<br/> <br/>Curves<br/>Color balance<br/>Sharpen<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  I know why I liked it, but I was looking for something more in the low 5s...not sure what went wrong ;) The light was direct sunlight. PP: CurvesColor balanceSharpen ', '2006-08-16 20:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735152, 375997, 45003, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bucket:</b></div><hr/><i>This shot is an example of what separates me from those who are technically perfect, the real pros..</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s why I love your stuff, hope you''ll continue with this beautiful style. Congratulations on your red ribbon!</td>', 'Originally posted by bucket:This shot is an example of what separates me from those who are technically perfect, the real pros..  That''s why I love your stuff, hope you''ll continue with this beautiful style. Congratulations on your red ribbon!', '2006-08-16 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735161, 376712, 50231, '<td valign="top">Oh Well!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-18 12:37:27.</i></td>', 'Oh Well!', '2006-08-16 20:41:20.000000', '2006-08-18 13:37:27.000000', 0),
(2735211, 376712, 19708, '<td valign="top">Congrats Paul on your first and Blue Ribbon to boot!<br/> <br/>You have found the recipe to wowing the voters here and presented us with a fine photograph. Don''t let negative comments get you down. It happens once in a while after the fact. You passed the voters approval, ended up with a Blue ribbon - just be proud of it.<br/>What if you did this in black &amp; white? Would you be guilty of emulating Ansel Adams? So what if you did? Many of us will die trying to learn a successful way of presenting a fine image.</td>', 'Congrats Paul on your first and Blue Ribbon to boot! You have found the recipe to wowing the voters here and presented us with a fine photograph. Don''t let negative comments get you down. It happens once in a while after the fact. You passed the voters approval, ended up with a Blue ribbon - just be proud of it.What if you did this in black & white? Would you be guilty of emulating Ansel Adams? So what if you did? Many of us will die trying to learn a successful way of presenting a fine image.', '2006-08-16 21:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735218, 377105, 55330, '<td valign="top">This would have looked alot better if they were all wearing football uniforms</td>', 'This would have looked alot better if they were all wearing football uniforms', '2006-08-16 21:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735465, 377607, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pic in the middle of buildings, poles, etc, etc.  I really like the shot, the focus is perfect, the only thing i find a little distracting is the strong white lines in the BG.  Again, the focus is so sharp the cats paw jumps out of the screen.</td>', 'Very interesting pic in the middle of buildings, poles, etc, etc.  I really like the shot, the focus is perfect, the only thing i find a little distracting is the strong white lines in the BG.  Again, the focus is so sharp the cats paw jumps out of the screen.', '2006-08-16 23:27:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735534, 376710, 50641, '<td valign="top">Goodness gracious, why didn''t this do better?  I gave it a 7. Cool pic, great way to meet the challenge.  You wuz robbed!</td>', 'Goodness gracious, why didn''t this do better?  I gave it a 7. Cool pic, great way to meet the challenge.  You wuz robbed!', '2006-08-16 23:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735607, 375997, 25952, '<td valign="top">siezing the moment is far more important than the technical quality of an image (which, I think is pretty nice here)..when it comes to shooting people.<br/>This has nice light, and the image conveys an overall feeling.<br/> <br/>I think a crop off of the left and the top somewhat though may help, great image though, I think it shoulda won.</td>', 'siezing the moment is far more important than the technical quality of an image (which, I think is pretty nice here)..when it comes to shooting people.This has nice light, and the image conveys an overall feeling. I think a crop off of the left and the top somewhat though may help, great image though, I think it shoulda won.', '2006-08-17 00:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2735645, 376712, 29282, '<td valign="top">Great shot Paul!  I love it when something other than the typical 4 models of Canon and Nikon wins.  It shows that after at some point, its NOT THE CAMERA!   Again, great work.</td>', 'Great shot Paul!  I love it when something other than the typical 4 models of Canon and Nikon wins.  It shows that after at some point, its NOT THE CAMERA!   Again, great work.', '2006-08-17 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
