(2737503, 377427, 30982, '<td valign="top">So I didn''t have to go far to find yours in this contest.  Congrats, dude!  Ribbon #1 of many more to follow, I''m sure!<br/> <br/>What makes the shot (and I''m sure you already know this) is the gold.  It''s still be good shot without it, but not as good.  Nice use of the ol'' fisheye - you''re having fun with that, aren''t you?  Congrats again!  Great picture, great finish.</td>', 'So I didn''t have to go far to find yours in this contest.  Congrats, dude!  Ribbon #1 of many more to follow, I''m sure! What makes the shot (and I''m sure you already know this) is the gold.  It''s still be good shot without it, but not as good.  Nice use of the ol'' fisheye - you''re having fun with that, aren''t you?  Congrats again!  Great picture, great finish.', '2006-08-17 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737508, 375997, 33068, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The lighting is outstanding!</td>', 'Excellent.  The lighting is outstanding!', '2006-08-17 19:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737511, 377446, 30982, '<td valign="top">Underrated, IMO.  Very nicely composed; like the fountains alot - those make this shot stand out from all the other building shots.  Colors are quiet and subtle, which could account for the lower score given DPC taste.  Looks to be a nice time of day to shoot, too - quiet light.</td>', 'Underrated, IMO.  Very nicely composed; like the fountains alot - those make this shot stand out from all the other building shots.  Colors are quiet and subtle, which could account for the lower score given DPC taste.  Looks to be a nice time of day to shoot, too - quiet light.', '2006-08-17 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737567, 373892, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this one a lot - like the empty swings and the way you framed the shot with the clouds and such.  I like the idea - nice relaxed kind of shot very reminiscent of summer.  Sky color seems just a wee bit off - maybe too cyan - but not enough to bother me.</td>', 'I like the composition of this one a lot - like the empty swings and the way you framed the shot with the clouds and such.  I like the idea - nice relaxed kind of shot very reminiscent of summer.  Sky color seems just a wee bit off - maybe too cyan - but not enough to bother me.', '2006-08-17 19:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737628, 377293, 63592, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. Shame it was disqualified.</td>', 'Lovely picture. Shame it was disqualified.', '2006-08-17 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737823, 375997, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great work.  Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Great work.  Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon.', '2006-08-17 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737856, 376712, 62554, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue! I was just a little surprised at your camera settings - was this really at f2.8 or was the decimal point in the wrong place?  I just don''t see how you could get sharpness from front to back with that f-stop.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue! I was just a little surprised at your camera settings - was this really at f2.8 or was the decimal point in the wrong place?  I just don''t see how you could get sharpness from front to back with that f-stop.', '2006-08-17 21:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737877, 377363, 35947, '<td valign="top">The coloring here is stunning!  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'The coloring here is stunning!  Wonderful shot!', '2006-08-17 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737917, 375997, 93, '<td valign="top">The more time spent worrying about being "Like the Pros", the less time you have for capturing something *real*<br/> <br/>This shot is all about the real..  The moment.<br/> <br/>We all dream of shots like this.</td>', 'The more time spent worrying about being "Like the Pros", the less time you have for capturing something *real* This shot is all about the real..  The moment. We all dream of shots like this.', '2006-08-17 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
