(2738567, 376712, 42135, '<td valign="top">Fantastic entry!! I didn''t vote on this but it certainly would have gotten a 10 from me.</td>', 'Fantastic entry!! I didn''t vote on this but it certainly would have gotten a 10 from me.', '2006-08-18 01:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2738964, 377360, 8860, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think you should be whining! This is a strong subject shot at a perfect time of day - nice one.</td>', 'Personally, I think you should be whining! This is a strong subject shot at a perfect time of day - nice one.', '2006-08-18 06:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2739135, 376710, 53147, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 5. I could have sworn you used a flash and did it well, but I now see otherwise. You have good color and detail on the critter. Did you have a tripod or just handheld? At that speed you did real well with keeping him in focus if handheld. Him being just so slightly off center is a bit off - not sure how to crop it other than dead center. I think you may have gotten lower votes because of the angle you took the pic. Seems more strraight on rather than from ground up.</td>', 'I scored this a 5. I could have sworn you used a flash and did it well, but I now see otherwise. You have good color and detail on the critter. Did you have a tripod or just handheld? At that speed you did real well with keeping him in focus if handheld. Him being just so slightly off center is a bit off - not sure how to crop it other than dead center. I think you may have gotten lower votes because of the angle you took the pic. Seems more strraight on rather than from ground up.', '2006-08-18 09:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2739527, 375997, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your rightful place now I think.<br/>: )</td>', 'Your rightful place now I think.: )', '2006-08-18 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
