(2743911, 375997, 39598, '<td valign="top">Congrats!<br/> <br/>You were very nearly cheated out of your much-deserved first place by an obvious fake. I''m really and truly happy for your sake that justice has been done, and that you can now fully enjoy the fruits of your efforts.<br/> <br/><b><i>On a side note...</i></b> <br/>I also hope that this sends a strong message to DPC''ers out there to get to know your craft.<br/>The vast majority of us won''t allege that a photo should be DQ''d unless we ACTUALLY know what we''re talking about.<br/>Well spotted, Imagineer!</td>', 'Congrats! You were very nearly cheated out of your much-deserved first place by an obvious fake. I''m really and truly happy for your sake that justice has been done, and that you can now fully enjoy the fruits of your efforts. On a side note... I also hope that this sends a strong message to DPC''ers out there to get to know your craft.The vast majority of us won''t allege that a photo should be DQ''d unless we ACTUALLY know what we''re talking about.Well spotted, Imagineer!', '2006-08-20 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
