(2744931, 377436, 42125, '<td valign="top">WOW! Congratulations on your first top 20 and your High Score!!!<br/>Really funny picture, love it how you made the cow bit tilted to add the feeling so that it looks a bit in the air.<br/>Good focus, good colours and light.<br/>Edited to say, not just top 20 but top 10%. That is a lot more!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-21 01:01:10.</i></td>', 'WOW! Congratulations on your first top 20 and your High Score!!!Really funny picture, love it how you made the cow bit tilted to add the feeling so that it looks a bit in the air.Good focus, good colours and light.Edited to say, not just top 20 but top 10%. That is a lot more!', '2006-08-21 01:59:31.000000', '2006-08-21 02:01:10.000000', 0),
(2745416, 377228, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice going Jeanne.  Another solid job on compostion.  I love the cropping you did on this one.  One suggestion, try playing around with levels on this one.  If you moved the white output level from 255 to about 225, it might give you some room to play around with saturation for the green leaves.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/> <br/>PS: I''m keeping my eye on you.</td>', 'Nice going Jeanne.  Another solid job on compostion.  I love the cropping you did on this one.  One suggestion, try playing around with levels on this one.  If you moved the white output level from 255 to about 225, it might give you some room to play around with saturation for the green leaves. Tim PS: I''m keeping my eye on you.', '2006-08-21 08:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
