(2745932, 374865, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''m with GuGi below.  I really liked this picture, but for the life of me, I couldn''t connect it to the challenge.  If it had been a free score, I would have given in a high mark.  I love the white on white and the abandoned feel to the room.</td>', 'I''m with GuGi below.  I really liked this picture, but for the life of me, I couldn''t connect it to the challenge.  If it had been a free score, I would have given in a high mark.  I love the white on white and the abandoned feel to the room.', '2006-08-21 12:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2746043, 376668, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Nice shot! My eyes went to the spider, the bottom right corner along the bottom and then back to the spider body<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>I like the balance of dark and green. Top left dark balances with the bottom right dark area. The spider balanced by the green area in the bottom right. I think I may have changed the angle slightly to see more of the spider body. <br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Meets challenge, but does not come across as an obvious looking up shot.<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>I like the lighting and colours. DOF is really shallow. Would have been nice to have more of the spider and web in focus. You didnt mention cropping. If this was out of camera placement, well done.<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>Nice capture and colours. The lack of obvious looking up and the shallow perspective on the spider may have hurt your score. Voters usually dont spend a lot of time figuring out what they are looking at. Good luck in future entries!<br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:Nice shot! My eyes went to the spider, the bottom right corner along the bottom and then back to the spider body Composition:I like the balance of dark and green. Top left dark balances with the bottom right dark area. The spider balanced by the green area in the bottom right. I think I may have changed the angle slightly to see more of the spider body.  Subject:Meets challenge, but does not come across as an obvious looking up shot. Technical:I like the lighting and colours. DOF is really shallow. Would have been nice to have more of the spider and web in focus. You didnt mention cropping. If this was out of camera placement, well done. Summary:Nice capture and colours. The lack of obvious looking up and the shallow perspective on the spider may have hurt your score. Voters usually dont spend a lot of time figuring out what they are looking at. Good luck in future entries!', '2006-08-21 13:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2746067, 374998, 62187, '<td valign="top">I forgot exactly what I commented about on this photo. Probably something regarding <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=58698" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">slickshooter</a>''s comment. Oh well, too bad he found the title ''offensive''. That''s what we call it, the helicopter - it''s a nickname. Maybe he should be glad they are on the offense. Anyway, looking back at it on a much better monitor - it''s a HORRIBLE photo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-22 13:10:13.</i></td>', 'I forgot exactly what I commented about on this photo. Probably something regarding  slickshooter''s comment. Oh well, too bad he found the title ''offensive''. That''s what we call it, the helicopter - it''s a nickname. Maybe he should be glad they are on the offense. Anyway, looking back at it on a much better monitor - it''s a HORRIBLE photo!', '2006-08-21 13:24:44.000000', '2008-11-22 13:10:13.000000', 0),
