(2764845, 377088, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is great! I didn''t vote on the challenge, so I''m sorry for not contributing to your score this time. It''s a tack sharp image with awesome light. I''m surprised this didn''t score even higher. I love the geometric shape that the babies'' beaks make. It must''ve been fun to see this!</td>', 'This is great! I didn''t vote on the challenge, so I''m sorry for not contributing to your score this time. It''s a tack sharp image with awesome light. I''m surprised this didn''t score even higher. I love the geometric shape that the babies'' beaks make. It must''ve been fun to see this!', '2006-08-27 18:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2765246, 375246, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hee - looks like you confused a lot of folks with this - but I know exactly what it is!  Truly a lovely blue sky, too.  You exposed well for the sky but the boot could use just a touch more light to it.  Still, I like this - very appropriate for the challenge, too!</td>', 'Hee - looks like you confused a lot of folks with this - but I know exactly what it is!  Truly a lovely blue sky, too.  You exposed well for the sky but the boot could use just a touch more light to it.  Still, I like this - very appropriate for the challenge, too!', '2006-08-27 21:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2765562, 377201, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - I didn''t vote in this challenge and I missed this beauty.  Really like the simplicity of it a lot.  Composition is excellent and it does indeed look like the clouds just continue right on into the building.  Very nicely seen!</td>', 'Wow - I didn''t vote in this challenge and I missed this beauty.  Really like the simplicity of it a lot.  Composition is excellent and it does indeed look like the clouds just continue right on into the building.  Very nicely seen!', '2006-08-28 00:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
