(2773584, 374758, 37719, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective, very well composed, extremely well exposed!  I am surprised this did not place higher.  The lines are crisp, the lights are perfect, the splashes of color really bring this shot together.  Very well done Sandy!</td>', 'Excellent perspective, very well composed, extremely well exposed!  I am surprised this did not place higher.  The lines are crisp, the lights are perfect, the splashes of color really bring this shot together.  Very well done Sandy!', '2006-08-30 08:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
