(2786666, 376027, 62187, '<td valign="top">I remember looking at this one during the challenge. It''s funny, you never know the photographers perspective during voting. But now, I see you have it listed under ''Humor''. Wow...I feel better. I really thought it was some kind of studio shot with toys and props. But now, I see it is for real! Didn''t anybody complain about it being built? I''m mean...it''s huge!</td>', 'I remember looking at this one during the challenge. It''s funny, you never know the photographers perspective during voting. But now, I see you have it listed under ''Humor''. Wow...I feel better. I really thought it was some kind of studio shot with toys and props. But now, I see it is for real! Didn''t anybody complain about it being built? I''m mean...it''s huge!', '2006-09-02 02:49:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2787782, 377411, 11854, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 in voting. If it had been me I would have cropped off the bottom leaving just the points on the building (with a little tiny bit of the underside) and the sky. The darkness at the bottom of the building is distracting.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 in voting. If it had been me I would have cropped off the bottom leaving just the points on the building (with a little tiny bit of the underside) and the sky. The darkness at the bottom of the building is distracting.', '2006-09-02 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
