(2791002, 376696, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hiya..<br/>Welcome to DPC.. .<br/>I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently..<br/> <br/>Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)<br/>Cheers<br/>----------------------------------------<br/> <br/>Well.. enough about the date stamp and light switch..<br/>You''ve got a good angle.. the thing might want to work on first would be on the framing.. I''ll worry about the exposure and lighting later.. <br/> <br/>I would put the camera on a tripod, set it on timer, use a really low shutter and small apperture.. on the lamp, off the flash and capture the ambience.. :)<br/> <br/>Good first attempt.. :)</td>', 'Hiya..Welcome to DPC.. .I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently.. Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)Cheers---------------------------------------- Well.. enough about the date stamp and light switch..You''ve got a good angle.. the thing might want to work on first would be on the framing.. I''ll worry about the exposure and lighting later..  I would put the camera on a tripod, set it on timer, use a really low shutter and small apperture.. on the lamp, off the flash and capture the ambience.. :) Good first attempt.. :)', '2006-09-03 04:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
