(2796141, 377457, 60370, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  It sheds a new light on my perspective of dragonflies.  He looks like a little man with wings!</td>', 'Great shot.  It sheds a new light on my perspective of dragonflies.  He looks like a little man with wings!', '2006-09-04 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2797496, 373892, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image.  The offcenter viewpoint actually adds to the "motion" of the swings as I can visualize the spin of the swings.  This is not a static shot at all.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image.  The offcenter viewpoint actually adds to the "motion" of the swings as I can visualize the spin of the swings.  This is not a static shot at all.', '2006-09-04 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2797740, 377427, 37858, '<td valign="top">A well-deserved ribbon.  This is one of the best of its kind IMHO.  The fish-eye was a good choice of lens.  The colors and composition are magnificent.</td>', 'A well-deserved ribbon.  This is one of the best of its kind IMHO.  The fish-eye was a good choice of lens.  The colors and composition are magnificent.', '2006-09-04 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2797750, 377446, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is a fine photo.  I think the only reason it did not score higher is because the frame of reference is fairly straight on.  If you could have shot this image from somewhere closer to the building and looking up the drama would have increased.  (I know, tough to do with a pond there.)  It certainly merits a higher score IMHO.</td>', 'This is a fine photo.  I think the only reason it did not score higher is because the frame of reference is fairly straight on.  If you could have shot this image from somewhere closer to the building and looking up the drama would have increased.  (I know, tough to do with a pond there.)  It certainly merits a higher score IMHO.', '2006-09-04 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2797819, 376710, 37858, '<td valign="top">Good color and clear for an shot in such light without a flash.  I think this was good enough to score even higher if you could have emphasized the "ground up" portion of the challenge, maybe from a more severe angle.  Of course, zoo personnel probably would have a problem with my suggestion. ;-)</td>', 'Good color and clear for an shot in such light without a flash.  I think this was good enough to score even higher if you could have emphasized the "ground up" portion of the challenge, maybe from a more severe angle.  Of course, zoo personnel probably would have a problem with my suggestion. ;-)', '2006-09-04 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 0),
