(2924475, 377425, 30982, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the unofficial Reaction Club<br/> <br/>At first, this is just a picture.  Look at it a bit longer, and it''s a child''s view.  Even longer and what I notice is the sunlight and shadow on the wall within the room, which looks somewhat sterile and empty, and *that* is where the story would begin were I an adept storyteller.  This one I might like in black and white.</td>', 'Greetings from the unofficial Reaction Club At first, this is just a picture.  Look at it a bit longer, and it''s a child''s view.  Even longer and what I notice is the sunlight and shadow on the wall within the room, which looks somewhat sterile and empty, and *that* is where the story would begin were I an adept storyteller.  This one I might like in black and white.', '2006-10-13 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
